title: "Moana-2.0: a reproducible ROMS configuration for the New Zealand region"
abstract: >-
  Configuration, build and run workflow for rebuilding the Moana Ocean
  Hindcast (5 km ROMS, New Zealand) and adding data assimilation, with the
  ROMS source, software environment, input data and every run recorded so
  results can be reproduced.
